# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit a real .env file or hardcode your API key in source files.
#
# Option 1 (Free Prototyping - Zero Billing Setup):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key and paste it below.
#    Note: Maps Demo Key is for prototyping only and has daily quota limits.
#
# Option 2 (Production Google Cloud Project):
# Enable Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), and Elevation API in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Restrict your key by HTTP referrer (for browser use) and IP address / APIs (for server BFF):
# https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
